pub const ABOUT : str = "igla-coder-gpu: the model verifies ITSELF through t27c -- rounds of (generate one sample per unresolved item -> t27c test-report -> stop the item at its first pass). Arms rotate per round: m<temp> masked, p<temp> plain. MEASURED 2026-09-29: diversity must come from mask RULES, not temperatures (3 rule-arms: compile 15/30 union vs 3/30 for 3 temps); plain arms are dead weight -- defaults are masked-only. Restart-safe: re-run with a larger --rounds to CONTINUE the rotation. Env: SC_OUT (default results/t27/selfcheck1), SC_ROUNDS (5), SC_ARMS (m0.8,w0.8,m0.7,w0.7 -- w = wide VALUE-core rule), SC_ITEMS (30), SC_STOP (pass|compile), SC_SEED=<int> (deterministic per-job sampling seeds; PAIRED A/Bs:   same seed base + same arms = identical streams, a pass delta is   causal; without it tc_fast is time-seeded and 30-item pass counts   are noise -- 2026-09-29 base30 3 vs repair30 0 on same code paths) SC_WORKERS (3), SC_REPAIR=1 (strip module-level lines + unterminated strings; keep ON), SC_EARLY=1 (abort repetition tail-locks mid-decode via engine \"x\", cascade_abort n=6/reps=3 -- gold-safe 0/466, catches 22/218 cascades; measured WEAK, A/B before trusting) SC_ITEMS_FILE=<jsonl> (default t27/items.jsonl): a different item set, e.g. results/t27/selftrain/items.jsonl (train-side yield; use SC_POOL=strict). NOTE the mask core is computed from that file too. SC_POOL=strict = every strict item (both mutants caught) of items.jsonl -- the honest full-bench number; NOTE --n-items still CUTS the pool after picking, so pass SC_ITEMS=500 with strict (the 2026-09-29 trap that silently ran 30 of 391), SC_KV_I8=1 (int8 KV cache: ~1.6x at 1.7K ctx, approximate -- pass numbers not comparable to f32-KV runs). SC_ANALYZE=1: free selector oracle over the committed v1/v2/v3 mask artifacts -- no model, no generation. The mask is FROZEN per run into <SC_OUT>/mask_snapshot.py (workers re-import it each round; editing scripts/ mid-run is now safe). SC_MASK_REV=<commit>: run with the mask as of that commit -- the paired baseline arm of a mask A/B (e.g. 305105e = pre-typed mask). SC_DIFF=1: every spec-test pass is diff-judged vs gold (diff_c tuples); diff_kill = compile, not pass, and the item keeps sampling. Not comparable to plain-pass runs. Heavy: run it remotely.";
